{"unit_id":"shkzhang__dsh-appearance#card-zh","repo":"shkzhang/dsh-appearance","commit":"e34d03da2e4b95d65b4cd83cb9a203beafab6192","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"DSH Appearance 是面向 DSH Web 的外观设置插件，在设置页提供统一的外观控制，并接入 DSH 主题和 settings seam。它可切换浅色、深色或跟随系统，并选择多种主题预设；还可调整 UI 与代码字体、字号、会话流和工具行间距，以及菜单和对话框的玻璃效果。设置页提供字体候选项，来源于本机系统字体目录。适合希望按个人阅读习惯调整 DSH Web 界面的人；无需 API Key 或外部服务。","source":"generated","evidence":["src/index.js:123-147","src/client.js:260-300"]}
{"unit_id":"shkzhang__dsh-appearance#card-en","repo":"shkzhang/dsh-appearance","commit":"e34d03da2e4b95d65b4cd83cb9a203beafab6192","type":"card","lang":"en","text":"DSH Appearance adds a settings page for DSH Web. Choose light, dark, or system mode and a theme preset; adjust UI and code fonts, sizes, conversation spacing, and glass effects for menus and dialogs. Font suggestions come from local system font directories. No API key or external service is needed.","source":"generated","evidence":["src/index.js:123-147","src/client.js:260-300"]}
